{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0340","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000039:text","row":47073,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「あー、俺も行くよ」","en":"“Ah—I’ll come too.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911048","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00001","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, I'll be coming too!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000000eb:text","row":47074,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はい、どうも」","en":"“...Thank you.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911049","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00002","en":"Miki: \"...yes, please do.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000117:text","row":47075,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"一人じゃ不安なのかな。","en":"Maybe she was afraid to go alone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911050","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00003","en":"She might get anxious if she's on her own.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000145:text","row":47076,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"また手を繋ぐ。","en":"We held hands again.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911051","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00004","en":"We join hands again.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000190:text","row":47077,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……なんでこんなことに……」","en":"“...How did this happen...?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911052","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00005","en":"Miki: \"...why is this even happening...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000001ce:text","row":47078,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「さあねえ」","en":"“Who knows.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911053","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00006","en":"Taichi: \"Dunno, dunno.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000278:text","row":47079,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「死体がないってことは、消えるんですよね？」","en":"“If there are no bodies, then everyone disappeared, didn’t they?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911054","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00007","en":"Miki: \"But there's no bodies, so does that mean they all just vanished?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000002c4:text","row":47080,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「みんなでどっか行ったのかも」","en":"“Maybe they all went somewhere.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911055","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00008","en":"Taichi: \"They've all gone somewhere, who knows.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000380:text","row":47081,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「どっかって……」","en":"“Somewhere...?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911056","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00009","en":"Miki: \"But where...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000003b2:text","row":47082,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほら、発電所あるし。避難したとか」","en":"“Well, there’s that power plant. Maybe everyone evacuated.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911057","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00010","en":"Taichi: \"Look, we have a power plant here. They might have evacuated.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000474:text","row":47083,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「ここ危ないってことですか？」","en":"“You mean it’s dangerous here?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911058","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00011","en":"Miki: \"Meaning that it's dangerous here?'","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","presentation"],"assessment":"The dialogue opens with a double quotation mark but ends with an apostrophe, leaving the quotation malformed.","remedy":"Use a matching closing double quotation mark.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":41,"start":0,"text":"Miki: \"Meaning that it's dangerous here?'"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000004b2:text","row":47084,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「さあ……わからない」","en":"“I don’t know.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911059","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00012","en":"Taichi: \"Well... I dunno.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000566:text","row":47085,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「それって……無線や電話が通じない理由にはならないと思います」","en":"“That still wouldn’t explain why neither the radio nor the phones work.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911060","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00013","en":"Miki: \"But then... I don't think that can be the reason for why the radio and the telephone aren't usable.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000005c4:text","row":47086,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、そうだな」","en":"“No. It wouldn’t.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911061","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00014","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, yeah, right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000006bf:text","row":47087,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"で、霧の家。","en":"Then we reached Kiri’s house.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911062","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00015","en":"And, Kiri's house.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000006e3:text","row":47088,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"美希と二人で、半分ずつ家を調べた。","en":"Miki and I split up and searched half the house each.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911063","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00016","en":"We explored the house half apiece, me and Miki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000725:text","row":47089,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうだった？」","en":"“How’d it go?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911064","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00017","en":"Taichi: \"Got anything?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000772:text","row":47090,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「いません？」","en":"“She’s not there?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911065","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00018","en":"Miki: \"She's not there?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000007a0:text","row":47091,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「こっちはいない」","en":"“Nothing on my side.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911066","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00019","en":"Taichi: \"Not where I looked.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000007ca:text","row":47092,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"美希の両肩が下がる。","en":"Miki’s shoulders sagged.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911067","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00020","en":"Miki's shoulders droop down.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:000008cf:text","row":47093,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「すれ違ったのかも。学校に戻ろうか？」","en":"“Maybe we missed her. Want to head back to school?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911068","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Maybe we've passed by each other and didn't meet. How about we return to school?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000993:text","row":47094,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「あの道を通ってるはずなんです！」","en":"“She would have taken that road!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911069","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00022","en":"Miki: \"She must have passed through that road, she must!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000a53:text","row":47095,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「すれ違ってるわけない……」","en":"“We couldn’t have missed her...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911070","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00023","en":"Miki: \"We can't have passed by each other...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000a8f:text","row":47096,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「先に学校に来てたのかも？」","en":"“Maybe she got to school before us?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911071","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Maybe she went to school ahead of us?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000b2c:text","row":47097,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911072","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00025","en":"Miki: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000b75:text","row":47098,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「ごめんなさい、わたし、さがしてきますっ」","en":"“I’m sorry. I’m going to look for her.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911073","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00026","en":"Miki: \"I'm sorry, I'll be searching for her!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000c92:text","row":47099,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"駆けていく。","en":"She ran off.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911074","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00027","en":"She dashes out.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000cbe:text","row":47100,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、おーい！」","en":"“Hey—wait!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911075","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00028","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, waaait!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000cee:text","row":47101,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「行っちゃった……」","en":"“She’s gone...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911076","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00029","en":"Taichi: \"And she's gone...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000e1f:text","row":47102,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"それから、美希は三日ほど霧を探し続けた。","en":"For about three days after that, Miki kept searching for Kiri.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911077","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00030","en":"And after that, Miki continued to search for\nKiri for three days.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000e58:text","row":47103,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"一日探索するごとに、美希は外部を拒絶していった。","en":"With every day she searched, Miki shut out more of the world.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911078","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00031","en":"In her day-long searching, Miki completely\nrejected the outside.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","undertranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that with each successive day of searching, Miki increasingly shut out the outside world. The English reduces this progression to one day-long search and presents the rejection as immediately complete.","remedy":"With every day she spent searching, Miki shut out the outside world a little more.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":25,"start":0,"text":"In her day-long searching"},{"color":"red","end":64,"start":32,"text":"completely\nrejected the outside."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000e99:text","row":47104,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"そして三日目、完全に閉じこもった。","en":"On the third day, she locked herself away completely.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911079","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00032","en":"And on the third day, the seclusion was complete.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000ecc:text","row":47105,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"いくら説得しても、出てくる気配はない。","en":"No matter how I tried to persuade her, she showed no sign of coming out.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911080","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00033","en":"However much persuasion I use, there is no\nindication that she will come out.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000f03:text","row":47106,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"もうその心は、絶望に完全に包まれてしまった。","en":"Her heart was utterly consumed by despair.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911081","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00034","en":"By now, that heart was completely enshrouded\nby despair.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0340:00000f69:text","row":47107,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"……失敗。","en":"...Failure.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:911082","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd4002a:00035","en":"...failure.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
